<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-29T02:40:01.832Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 02:40:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed attackers killed at least 60 Orthodox Christians in two separate incidents in Oromia and a drone strike killed two government civil servants in western Oromia. Senior Tigray Military Commander Major General Yohannes was captured near the Eritrean border. Ethiopia received delivery of 12 Russian Su-35 fighter jets and announced plans for S-400 air defenses amid rising tensions with Eritrea. Up to 50,000 Ethiopians have fled across the Kenya border into Moyale County. The UCDP recorded 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQSl9RZXktMzNjWWNNLUtNT1AySlhCNTltZ1ktWENhQVFWaVd3aGdDMkRZVFgzZktHWHp3Z0RKcENRb3NueEs0UHZRcS1yTmVlZTRrNndOSEhTRHBEVGJnQmc5WS1zMnQ5Ymx0VVRGNVpnR25oWG5UaVR6MTA1WXVoZXlQNEQ0WWdOeHB6eGhBSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1jSlVYMnRkUUdqbGM3R09kb2FrN0tCLWpEVFkxa0FZWnNEaWhLY0w1WGw5c1BDd1dPbEtaMXVYWWFld3lLNU9hNlRGbFlzUVRE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQc1JDTEZvV2htSjRjY19kYTViMEN3NGZiQTJIbkRldG1xaEJheG9wM2tlS3JPdDY5SFJsUFZITk9QV0lCeUtuYzNrbzZaYVFjbDdYVXRTVDBvMDJCSjkxeGFwVGNlTEQ0ZEoyNTlQTTdMTkhhSWJUbjVhZExCV214YWxjNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;International Christian Concern&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPUEl5MzlpUlgxbFJDanVVY1phZFg0dFAxVnAzNVhsb1VwM1UzMFlmd1FyUTRmdGU5MHdYeEJqcFNmZk9EbzNuZjNGZzBEcldaRjR2aWpSaEx4TWpUWUx0RVkyRTYzcmpHX1hVblpETV9Jb1YzRS1PUlBOTE5ydGFnNTEtb3JuTXRo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Beirut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNS3dCTGFmMjVISkdyY3RLOW9ZMllwR0pia29mYW1XWUpJaEQtc0FfS01qNFBPSzdHSnZVMGhKa